    dcterms:modified "2025-10-06T18:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:title "EDMA Financial Industry Business Ontology (FIBO) Financial Business and Commerce (FBC) Domain, European and North American Extensions" ;
    rdfs:comment "同时引入 FBC 域的欧洲扩展与北美扩展，便于业务横跨两大法域的应用一次加载全部区域性内容。"@zh ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/> ;
    owl:imports <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/AllFBC-Europe/>,
        <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/AllFBC-NorthAmerica/> ;
    owl:versionIRI <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/20261001/AllFBC-EuropeAndNorthAmerica/> ;
    cmns-av:copyright "Copyright (c) 2015-2025 Object Management Group, Inc.",
        "Copyright (c) 2015-2026 EDM Association dba EDM Council, Inc." ;
    cmns-av:explanatoryNote "The 'all' ontology for the European and North American Extension of FBC is provided for convenience for FIBO users. This ontology does not add new assertions, but imports most of the Production (Released) ontologies that comprise the FIBO Foundations (FND), Business Entities (BE) and Financial Business and Commerce (FBC) domains, including all of FND as well as individuals for European and North American governments and jurisdictions, financial services and regulatory organizations and related registries, as well as the related LCC region-specific ontologies." .

